[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590500910","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101545#issuecomment-2590500910","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101545","id":2590500910,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aZ-gu","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T16:40:01Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T16:43:02Z","body":"That is a natural byproduct of that used cell layout as astar does not seach your entire map and all polygons.\n\nYou can get a more optimized navmesh that mitigates this problem by using a NavigationRegion2D to bake your TileMap instead of using the TileMap build-in cell navigation.\n\nSee my post in the Godot forum for additional information why  those artifical polygon edges added by the TileMap in the middle of nowhere are a problem for how astar searches and builds path corridors. https://forum.godotengine.org/t/strange-results-from-3d-navmesh-generation-and-paths/91782/2?u=smix8","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590500910/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952488645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101545#issuecomment-2952488645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101545","id":2952488645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v-2bF","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-07T13:22:10Z","updated_at":"2025-06-07T13:22:10Z","body":"As with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105705 this is not a bug, it is a general limitation that come with such navmesh layouts. This and all related layout-sourced issues can only be solved by adding new features like different pathfinding algorithms or line-of-sight checks (apart from the solution of changing the layout).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952488645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused"